ent workflows including printer discovery, connection setup, search functionality, and troubleshooting. The implementation demonstrates advanced patterns such as retry logic, platform-specific handling, dynamic element identification, and multi-step flow orchestration. The class extensively uses the SmartFlow base class driver methods for element interaction and includes detailed verification methods for UI validation across multiple printer-related screens."}